	(footprint "Footprints:Supercap_Radial_D8.0mm_H12.0mm_P3.50mm"
		(layer "B.Cu")
		(uuid "f501aeb9-a7e6-4930-b063-7e5ef307cb7f")
		(at 87.5 147.03 90)
		(descr "Cylindrical radial EDLC supercapacitor, vertical (standing) mount. Can 8.0 mm dia x 12.0 mm long nominal; the CDA drawing allows D +/-1.0 and L +/-1.5, so up to 9.0 mm dia x 13.5 mm seated. Two straight radial leads, 0.6 mm dia on a 3.50 mm pitch (+/-0.5). Drawn for CDA/Zhifengwei CXHP2R7205R-TW (2.0 F, 2.7 V; ESR 100 mohm @1 kHz / 280 mohm DC, per the CXHP 2.7V series table, also 8x12 in the 2024-10 edition). DigiKey lists an 18.00 mm seated height for it, which contradicts CDA and its own 8X12 description. Drill 0.9 mm gives 0.3 mm clearance on the lead. Pad 1 = POSITIVE; the silk hatch marks the negative half, where the sleeve carries its stripe. Courtyard drawn at the 9.0 mm maximum can diameter + 0.25 mm. Geometry otherwise the stock Capacitor_THT:CP_Radial_D8.0mm_P3.50mm. Datasheet: CDA CXHP(2.7V) Series, spec date 2022-06-10.")
